CORE
wc.c
--mmio-ioremap _ --no-pointer-check --no-bounds-check
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
Derived MMIO region from ioremap_wc: 0x1000 size 256
value read back from weak region: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
ioremap_wc maps write-combining (weak) memory, so the region is auto-derived as
weak: reads return a non-deterministic value and the read-back is not
guaranteed. The device-memory type is recovered from the source (the ioremap
variant) with no user configuration.
